OL,3,ACyber attack on police force may have
OL,4,A'compromised' staff information
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Information Commissioner's Office
OL,7,F(ICO) has been notified, with a
OL,8,Fspokesperson saying: "We can confirm we
OL,9,Fhave received a breach report from
OL,10,FDyfed-Powys Police and we are assessing
OL,11,Fthe information provided."
